      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AUDREY'S MAGIC (3) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by half a length at this track in a handy 17.87. Fair draw can see a good run and goes well over this trip. Goes very well from this draw with three wins and three minor placings from seven starts. Expected to measure up again. VILIAME (1) missed the frame latest when eighth at this track (19.07) but scored five back at this track (17.95). In the mix. MIGHTY LAD (8) was below best at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth at this track, but was among the placings at this track three back. Can turn it around this time. TARAWI TANK (2) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
